  - speaker: Greenie
    text: "U\u1ED1ng thu\u1ED1c gi\u1EA3i n\xE0y \u0111i!"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: "T\xED (T\u1EC9nh l\u1EA1i)"
    text: "C\u1EA3m \u01A1n anh... Em \u1ED5n h\u01A1n nhi\u1EC1u r\u1ED3i. \u0110\xE2y
